Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same emergency stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Only one of\Nthese cars can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:03.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,still steer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:05.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Slam the\Nbrakes without ABS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the wheels lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,A locked\Ntire stops rolling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,and starts to slide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:10.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a sliding\Ntire can't push
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:11.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,the car sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:13.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,So turn the\Nwheel all you want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:14.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the car still goes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:14.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,ABS stops\Nthe wheels from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,locking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:18.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Behind each\Nwheel a sensor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.81,0:00:20.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,counts the teeth\Non a spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:20.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,ring
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:22.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,so the computer\Nknows how fast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:23.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,every wheel is turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:24.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,When one\Nwheel slows down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,faster than the\Ncar it's about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:26.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,to lock
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:28.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,so ABS eases\Nthe brake on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:29.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,that wheel\Nfor an instant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.13,0:00:30.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,and squeezes again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.27,0:00:32.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,many times a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:33.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,The tire keeps\Nrolling at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:34.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,edge of its grip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:35.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,so it can still steer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,That buzz in\Nthe pedal is ABS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:38.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,working.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep pressing and steer.
